<section class="phero"><div class="wrap"><p class="kicker"><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora{% endif %}">NEVORA</a></p><h1 class="t1 rise">NEVORA terms of use</h1><p class="lede fade">The rules for using NEVORA.</p><p class="doc-meta">Effective October 20, 2026</p></div></section><section class="doc"><div class="wrap doc-grid"><div class="doc-aside"><details class="doc-toc" open><summary class="doc-aside-t">On this page</summary><nav aria-label="Page contents"><a href="#p-0">Using NEVORA</a><a href="#p-1">Your account</a><a href="#p-2">Work records and employment</a><a href="#p-3">Acceptable use</a><a href="#p-4">Your content</a><a href="#p-5">Reporting concerns</a><a href="#p-6">Privacy and deletion</a><a href="#p-7">Access to the service</a><a href="#p-8">App license</a><a href="#p-9">Changes and contact</a></nav></details><p class="doc-aside-t">Also for NEVORA</p><nav aria-label="Other NEVORA pages"><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-privacy{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-privacy{% endif %}">NEVORA privacy policy</a><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-support{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-support{% endif %}">NEVORA support</a><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-account-deletion{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-account-deletion{% endif %}">Delete your NEVORA account</a></nav></div><div class="doc-body"><section id="p-0"><i>01</i><h2>Using NEVORA</h2><p>NEVORA is provided by VELANI LLC for authorized workforce scheduling and operations. Use it only for a workspace you’re authorized to access, under these terms and applicable law. Your organization may have a separate service agreement with VELANI LLC.</p></section><section id="p-1"><i>02</i><h2>Your account</h2><p>Keep your sign-in details private, give accurate information when asked, and report suspected unauthorized access to <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a>. Use only your own sign-in and permissions. Your organization manages work assignments and access by role. Report incorrect work records through the correction process or to your workplace administrator.</p></section><section id="p-2"><i>03</i><h2>Work records and employment</h2><p>NEVORA helps record and share workplace information. Your employer remains responsible for its employment decisions, payroll obligations and workplace rules. Follow your workplace’s approval process to change attendance or other work records. These terms don’t waive any employment, wage, privacy or other legal rights.</p></section><section id="p-3"><i>04</i><h2>Acceptable use</h2><p>Don’t harass, threaten, impersonate, discriminate against or abuse anyone. Don’t share unlawful or sexually exploitative content, expose someone’s private information without authority, send malware, try to get access you aren’t given, or falsify or tamper with work records. Use workplace communications for their intended purpose and respect intellectual property and confidentiality.</p></section><section id="p-4"><i>05</i><h2>Your content</h2><p>You keep any rights you have in what you submit. You allow VELANI LLC, and the service providers working for it, to process it as needed to run NEVORA, deliver it to its intended audience, protect the service and meet applicable obligations. Only submit content you’re allowed to share.</p></section><section id="p-5"><i>06</i><h2>Reporting concerns</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a> to report content or behavior that breaks these rules, including concerns about an administrator. Describe the item and where it appears, without extra personal information. We review concerns and may remove content or restrict accounts. Your workplace’s own reporting channels are also available.</p></section><section id="p-6"><i>07</i><h2>Privacy and deletion</h2><p>Our <a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-privacy{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-privacy{% endif %}">Privacy Policy</a> explains how information is handled and your choices. You can request account deletion from Profile; see <a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-account-deletion{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-account-deletion{% endif %}">Account deletion</a>. Some workplace records may be kept for the specific purposes and periods explained there.</p></section><section id="p-7"><i>08</i><h2>Access to the service</h2><p>Features depend on your role and your organization’s settings. We may restrict access to address security incidents, misuse or loss of authorization. Email <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a> about a restriction or a service problem. These terms don’t create any charge for you.</p></section><section id="p-8"><i>09</i><h2>App license</h2><p>For the iOS app, Apple’s standard end-user license agreement applies unless VELANI LLC provides its own through the App Store. These terms apply alongside that license as the law allows.</p></section><section id="p-9"><i>10</i><h2>Changes and contact</h2><p>We post updated terms with their effective date and give additional notice, or ask you to accept them, where required. Contact VELANI LLC at <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a> or by mail at VELANI LLC, 1654 Calle Tulipan, Suite 100, San Juan, PR 00927.</p></section><div class="doc-end"><p class="hkick">Questions</p><p>Write to <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a>.</p><div class="acts"><a class="pill line" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-support{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-support{% endif %}">NEVORA support</a></div></div></div></div></section>
